---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHeader from '../../components/PageHeader.astro';
import CtaBand from '../../components/CtaBand.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Joint Ventures"
  description="Floyd Homes and Land partners with buyers and sellers through joint ventures, for clients who want to capitalize on more than a simple sale."
>
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="What we do · Joint ventures"
    title="Partner with us on more than a sale."
    lede="FHL specializes in land development and investment, and we're always looking for opportunities to joint venture with buyers or sellers."
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap grid-2">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>Who it's for</h2>
        <p>
          Buyers and sellers who want to capitalize on more than a simple sale. Like development, a
          joint venture is evaluated case by case, and it isn't the right move for everyone.
        </p>
        <p class="todo">[[TODO: Dustin to describe how a JV with FHL usually works: who brings what, how decisions are made, how it pays out]]</p>
      </div>
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>Investing in a deal instead?</h2>
        <p>
          If you want to put money into an FHL deal rather than partner with land or a property you
          already have, see the invest page.
        </p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/invest/">Invest with FHL</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/start/partner/">Tell us about your project</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CtaBand />
</Base>
